{"rank": 99, "root": "وكل", "form": 5, "lemma": "تَوَكَّلَ", "count": 40, "ayahCount": 38, "share": 0.21, "meaning": {"bs": "osloniti se, pouzdati se", "en": "to rely, to trust", "tr": "dayanmak, güvenmek", "fr": "s'en remettre, faire confiance", "id": "bertawakal, bergantung", "ur": "بھروسا کرنا، توکل کرنا", "bn": "ভরসা করা, নির্ভর করা", "fa": "توکل کردن، اعتماد کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/9837592155bff64c21b8.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-tawakkala_5\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes tawakkala_5-t{from{transform:rotate(0)}}@keyframes tawakkala_5-a{from{transform:rotate(0)}}.va-tawakkala_5 .tr{transform:rotate(20deg);animation:tawakkala_5-t 1.4s ease-in-out both}.va-tawakkala_5 .ra{transform:rotate(-70deg);animation:tawakkala_5-a 1.4s ease-in-out both}.va-tawakkala_5 .la{transform:rotate(-60deg);animation:tawakkala_5-a 1.4s ease-in-out both}.va-tawakkala_5 .ll{transform:rotate(-14deg)}.va-tawakkala_5 .rl{transform:rotate(-4deg)}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-tawakkala_5.off,.va-tawakkala_5.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-tawakkala_5,.va-tawakkala_5 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"q\" d=\"M66 61V10h12v51z\"/><g transform=\"translate(52 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "تَوَكَّلَ", "plain": "تَوَكَّلَ", "